<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">03092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Gaza's health ministry says one thousand three hundred and thirty-four people have been killed since the ceasefire declared last October.</s> <s>Israeli forces still hold roughly sixty percent of the territory and have rejected withdrawal, calling near-daily strikes threat removal despite the truce's ban on bombardment.</s> <s>A ceasefire that one party can fire through isn't an end to violence — it's a change of name, and the casualty count is the one figure that didn't change.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>American strikes on Iran resumed this week after a month-long pause, and one strike on a wedding killed five people near Sirik.</s> <s>Tehran answered the same night with missiles and drones aimed at US positions in Jordan, after Washington hit rocket launchers on Larak Island.</s> <s>The pause held for a month without any agreement behind it — which tells you it was operational, not diplomatic, and nothing prevents the next one from simply ending too.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Under a policy the US command calls tanker-for-tanker, American drones have struck at least two Iranian oil tankers — one vessel for every attack on shipping in the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>That widens the target set from military sites to the revenue base of a state, and the crews on those ships are usually third-country nationals from South and Southeast Asia with no part in the dispute.</s> <s>Reciprocity as a targeting rule is an escalation ladder with no top rung... because it hands the decision to escalate to the adversary.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Germany's police have opened a terrorism investigation after two electrical substations were hit with homemade explosives, one in Brandenburg and one in the west.</s> <s>A substation is unmanned, unguarded, and takes months to replace, which makes it the cheapest way to impose real cost on a country that can't legally call it an armed attack.</s> <s>That's the point of infrastructure sabotage — no casualties, no uniform, no claim, and therefore no threshold crossed and no war declared.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Financial Times has documented a covert Russian-Iranian missile programme, codenamed C-four-three-zero-L, running since twenty twenty-three.</s> <s>The evidence is leaked correspondence, travel records and military patent filings — Russian specialists helping Tehran build supersonic, ramjet-powered cruise missiles that would outrun the defences currently deployed against Iran's subsonic arsenal.</s> <s>Sanctions regimes are built to stop hardware at a border, and what's moving here is engineering knowledge — people, drawings, patents — which no export-control list can seize.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington has agreed to let Saudi Arabia enrich uranium to twenty percent, without the additional safeguards Iran once volunteered.</s> <s>American officials cited that very same twenty percent threshold as proof of weapons intent when Iran reached it in twenty-ten.</s> <s>Riyadh now holds a permission Tehran was bombed over — and the zero-enrichment demand Washington still makes of Iran has just lost its principle.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Mandi Bahauddin, gunmen shot an Ahmadi man dead near Eidgah Road, in a country whose constitution classifies Ahmadis as non-Muslim.</s> <s>Pakistani law bars them from Islamic religious practice and lists them separately on the electoral roll, which makes the minority identifiable to anyone who wants to find them.</s> <s>When the state writes the category, it also supplies the map — and the police say they're still looking for a motive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>More than seventy-two thousand people crossed into Ceuta in July, and protests have spread across Spain demanding Prime Minister Pedro Sánchez resign over his handling of it.</s> <s>A Spanish police report found Moroccan forces showed what it called total permissiveness as migrants crossed — pressure at that frontier has moved with Madrid and Rabat's diplomatic temperature for years.</s> <s>The border is a lever, not weather... and the people crossing it are largely absent from the argument Spain is having about them.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Brent crude sits near ninety-six dollars, up ten percent in a month, and markets now put the odds of a US rate hike at two in three.</s> <s>A war usually sends money into bonds, but an oil shock is an inflation shock, so the safe asset is the one being sold.</s> <s>A central bank has one instrument and can't tell a price rise caused by a tanker strike from one caused by domestic demand — so it treats both the same, and every floating-rate borrower on earth pays for a war they aren't in.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's statistics ministry has revised the previous year's economic base downward by about seven percent, moving the base year from twenty-eleven to twenty twenty-two.</s> <s>Growth is a ratio, so shrinking the denominator raises the headline figure without a single extra rupee of output.</s> <s>Rebasing national accounts is ordinary and often necessary — the honesty test is whether the old and new series are published side by side long enough for anyone to check, and the first quarter's numbers won't be final until February.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uber shut down its operations in Nigeria and Uganda with no notice, and is cutting three thousand three hundred corporate jobs worldwide, about a tenth of its staff.</s> <s>Drivers in Lagos and Kampala work as contractors, so the company can leave without severance or warning, while their vehicle loans stay outstanding.</s> <s>The classification that made the business cheap to build is the same one that makes it costless to abandon.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nepal's overland trade corridor to China has closed again after flooding in the Himalayas.</s> <s>The route is the country's only alternative to routing everything through India, and it's been shut repeatedly by floods and landslides for years now.</s> <s>Kathmandu has to decide whether a corridor that closes every monsoon counts as leverage at all.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Queensland coroner has found that a six-year-old boy in Brisbane died of scurvy — a vitamin C deficiency — after doctors and child-safety services had flagged his diet for years.</s> <s>The disease is now so rare in Australia that it was found only in post-mortem scans, because clinicians aren't trained to look for a nineteenth-century deficiency at a modern appointment.</s> <s>The multivitamin he'd been given, which contained no vitamin C, remains on sale.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>More than three thousand six hundred people in South Africa's Western Cape have started lenacapavir, an injectable that prevents HIV with two clinic visits a year instead of six.</s> <s>Real-world protection is governed by whether people can keep coming back, so the dosing interval does more than any change in the molecule — but severe supply limits mean it reaches only three hundred and sixty clinics across six provinces.</s> <s>Gilead has licensed generic manufacturers whose versions aren't yet registered, so for now who gets the six-month schedule is a distribution decision, not a clinical one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China's carbon emissions fell one percent last quarter, and the cause is oil, not coal or recession.</s> <s>Electric vehicles cut transport oil use by sixteen percent even as coal-fired power output rebounded — a demand-side fall driven by hundreds of millions of cars, buses and two-wheelers bought one at a time, not by any summit.</s> <s>Emissions drop for two very different reasons, recession or substitution, and only substitution lasts — though Beijing's new five-year energy plans set no quantitative targets, so this is one quarter, not a peak.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A hundred and fifty millimetres of rain flooded three sectors of Islamabad on Tuesday, in a city built entirely to a master plan.</s> <s>Dawn reports one housing society narrowed a drainage channel from forty feet to eighteen — with the capital authority's own approval.</s> <s>Flood risk is set by blocked drainage and sealed ground long before it's set by rainfall, which means a permit caused this flood as surely as the weather did, and only one of those can be fixed this year.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>More than a dozen Serbians, student activists among them, learned they'd been targeted with mercenary spyware — not from a court or a regulator, but from a notification sent by Apple.</s> <s>Forensic analysis by the SHARE Foundation found Pegasus and NoviSpy-style malware, tools sold to states as a licensed subscription service.</s> <s>Surveillance that once required a national intelligence agency is now a procurement line item, and a phone vendor's alert has become the closest thing the world has to a disclosure regime.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>UNICEF estimates that about twenty million internet-using children were sexually exploited or abused online in a single year across twenty-one countries — and fewer than one percent of those cases reached police.</s> <s>Most of it happened on mainstream social and messaging apps, not the hidden corners the policy debate imagines.</s> <s>Policy is written against measured harm, so a system that captures one case in a hundred will under-resource the response by exactly that much.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google has shipped a cybersecurity-specialised variant of its Gemini model, priced at seventy-five cents per million tokens and gated behind an invite-only defenders programme.</s> <s>Vendors have spent two years insisting frontier models are general-purpose and safety-gated — a named cyber model with a price per token is the moment that capability becomes a product.</s> <s>The allowlist is the entire control surface, which means Google alone decides who holds it.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>